                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for sarah &amp;lt;sarah@whamcloud.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/eb82451e-6902-11e4-9d25-5254006e85c2" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.hpdd.intel.com/test_sets/eb82451e-6902-11e4-9d25-5254006e85c2&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sub-test test_101 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;version must match
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;CMD: onyx-40vm1.onyx.hpdd.intel.com lctl get_param -n mgc.*.ir_state
 recovery-small test_101: @@@@@@ FAIL: version must match 
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Info required for matching: recovery-small 101&lt;/p&gt;</description>
